   "fen": "r3kb1r/1b1n1ppp/4p3/1pp1P3/3p4/3P1N2/PP1B1PPP/RN3RK1 w kq - 0 16",
   "line": [
    "d4"
   ],
   "spoken": "The obvious central push opens the bishop's diagonal and leans on both weaknesses at once. Note what not to do — the other pawn advance would simply let the opponent free themselves with a break of their own.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
   "ply": 31,
   "t": 1813,
   "fen": "r3kb1r/1b1n1ppp/4p3/1pp1P3/3p1B2/3P1N2/PP3PPP/RN3RK1 b kq - 1 16",
   "line": [
