    "Bf8"
   ],
   "spoken": "To finally engineer the breakthrough, the targets have to be shored up in the right order: a rook drop would hang a pawn, so tuck the bishop back to f8 first to guard one weakness, then cover the other, then swing the rook across — and only then is the pawn break ready.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
   "ply": 51,
   "t": 2027.5,
   "fen": "r1r2b2/5p1k/4p3/1pp1P1pp/n2p1P2/PN1P2BP/1PR2P2/4R1K1 b - - 0 26",
